{"id":"cf333f3d-c0da-4fee-9bea-8f05859712a8","title":"Silk Curtain 3","slug":"silk-curtain-3","collectionSlug":"silk-curtain","collectionName":"Silk Curtain","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A sophisticated fabric shader effect featuring a rich, dark brown base with warm orange-amber tones. The primary Satin component creates a luxurious textile appearance with visible fold geometry (3 folds at 90-degree direction) that produces dramatic light and shadow variations across the surface. The base color #300e04 is extremely dark brown, nearly black, while highlight reflections in #f58758 create warm orange-copper accents that simulate light catching on fabric folds. A subtle starfield effect is overlaid via the DotGrid component, adding tiny white sparkles (density 28, size 0.09) at 7% opacity with a linear dodge blend mode, creating a twinkling, celestial quality. The DisplacementMap applies a subtle directional distortion (0.06 amount) using the satin texture as source, creating micro-ripples and surface irregularities that enhance the fabric's three-dimensional appearance. The overall effect suggests a draped, folded satin material photographed under warm directional lighting, with an ethereal starfield overlay. The ACES tone mapping provides cinematic color grading. The atmosphere is luxurious, dramatic, and slightly mystical due to the stellar elements.","colors":["#300e04","#f58758","#ffffff"],"labels":["textured","3d","dark","dramatic"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/cf333f3d-c0da-4fee-9bea-8f05859712a8.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"Satin","id":"idmv12gmafe4lcavhxn","_key":"key_mv12gmafe4lcavhxn","props":{"fill":0.35,"seed":60,"bloom":1,"color":"#300e04","gloss":0.03,"sheen":0,"speed":4,"weave":0,"breeze":0.21,"opacity":1,"pinning":1,"maskType":"alpha","blendMode":"normal","foldCount":3,"foldDepth":1,"foldWidth":0.4,"transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0}